  "guidelines": "Every Version 16 teaching page is rewritten in the Study Studio Prompt 2 teaching-script style, with no word limit. Study Studio teaching notes per source page, in source order, with bolded teaching bullets of connected spoken sentences and nested sub-bullets. Experiments are told naturally without report labels, figures are explained by their scientific meaning instead of a walkthrough of axes, panels or colors, and only the numbers that define conditions, carry key findings or report statistics are kept. Wording uses simple order and avoids crowded or tongue-twisting phrases. No metacommentary, presentation narration, colons or semicolons, or outside material. Title, divider and link-only pages remain visible without invented explanations. Earlier editions are not rewritten.",
